IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa13-ch3-preemption`

-- coa13-tests-ch3.l4: tests for coa13-ch3-preemption.l4 (ss 560 to 577). Every expected value is written from the text of the
-- section named beside it, before the code was run. A test of a "not covered" case asserts NOTHING.

§ `Tests for Part 17, Chapter 3`

-- s 560(1): "ordinary shares" are shares other than those that, as respects dividends and capital, carry a right to participate only up to a specified amount.
#ASSERT `s 560(1) the shares are ordinary shares` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 560(1) the shares are ordinary shares` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 560(1) the shares are ordinary shares` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 560(1) the shares are ordinary shares` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 560(1): "equity securities" are ordinary shares in the company, or rights to subscribe for or convert into them.
#ASSERT `s 560(1) the thing is an equity security` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 560(1) the thing is an equity security` (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 560(1) the thing is an equity security` NOTHING TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 560(1) the thing is an equity security` NOTHING FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 560(1) the thing is an equity security` NOTHING FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 560(2): the allotment of equity securities includes the grant of a right, and does not include the allotment of shares pursuant to one.
#ASSERT `s 560(2) the transaction is an allotment of equity securities for the purposes of Chapter 3` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 560(2) the transaction is an allotment of equity securities for the purposes of Chapter 3` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 560(2) the transaction is an allotment of equity securities for the purposes of Chapter 3` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 560(3): includes the sale of ordinary shares held as treasury shares.
#ASSERT `s 560(3) the sale is an allotment of equity securities for the purposes of Chapter 3` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 560(3) the sale is an allotment of equity securities for the purposes of Chapter 3` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 560(3) the sale is an allotment of equity securities for the purposes of Chapter 3` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 561(1)(a): the offer to each holder, on the same or more favourable terms, in proportion to nominal value held.
#ASSERT `s 561(1)(a) the company has made the offers required` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 561(1)(a) the company has made the offers required` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 561(1)(a) the company has made the offers required` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 561(1)(a) the company has made the offers required` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A holder of ordinary shares of nominal value 100 in a company whose ordinary share capital is 1000 is to be offered one-tenth;
-- of 500 securities that is 50 (as nearly as practicable equal to the proportion in nominal value).
#ASSERT `s 561(1)(a) the proportion of the securities to be offered to the holder` 100 1000 EQUALS 0.1
#ASSERT `s 561(1)(a) the number of the equity securities to be offered to the holder` 500 100 1000 EQUALS 50
#ASSERT `s 561(1)(a) the number of the equity securities to be offered to the holder` 500 250 1000 EQUALS 125
-- s 561(1)(b): the offer period has expired or every offer has been accepted or refused.
#ASSERT `s 561(1)(b) the period has expired or every offer has been accepted or refused` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 561(1)(b) the period has expired or every offer has been accepted or refused` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 561(1)(b) the period has expired or every offer has been accepted or refused` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 561(4): treasury shares are disregarded: the company is not treated as a holder; the shares are not part of the ordinary share capital.
#ASSERT `s 561(4) the shares are disregarded for the purposes of section 561` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 561(4) the shares are disregarded for the purposes of section 561` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 561(4)(a) the company is treated as a person who holds ordinary shares` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 561(4)(a) the company is treated as a person who holds ordinary shares` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 561(4)(b) the shares are treated as forming part of the ordinary share capital` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 561(4)(b) the shares are treated as forming part of the ordinary share capital` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 561(2): securities offered may be allotted to the holder or his renouncee without contravening (1)(b).
#ASSERT `s 561(2) the allotment contravenes section 561(1)(b)` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 561(2) the allotment contravenes section 561(1)(b)` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 561(2) the allotment contravenes section 561(1)(b)` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 561(5): the sections to which s 561 is subject. A builder over the eight answers, in the order the record declares them.
GIVEN a IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN, b IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN, c IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN, d IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN, e IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN, f IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN, g IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN, h IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 561(5) the sections to which section 561 is subject`
`s 561(5) test record` MEANS `s 561(5) the sections to which section 561 is subject` WITH
    `s 561(5)(a) the answer of section 564` IS a
    `s 561(5)(a) the answer of section 565` IS b
    `s 561(5)(a) the answer of section 566` IS c
    `s 561(5)(a) the answer of section 566A` IS d
    `s 561(5)(b) the answer of section 567` IS e
    `s 561(5)(b) the answer of section 568(2)` IS f
    `s 561(5)(c) the answer of sections 569 to 573` IS g
    `s 561(5)(d) the answer of section 576` IS h

#ASSERT `s 561(5) section 561 is displaced by one of the sections to which it is subject` (`s 561(5) test record` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 561(5) section 561 is displaced by one of the sections to which it is subject` (`s 561(5) test record` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 561(5) section 561 is displaced by one of the sections to which it is subject` (`s 561(5) test record` NOTHING NOTHING (JUST TRUE) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 561(5) section 561 is displaced by one of the sections to which it is subject` (`s 561(5) test record` NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST TRUE) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 561(5) section 561 is displaced by one of the sections to which it is subject` (`s 561(5) test record` NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST TRUE) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 561(5) section 561 is displaced by one of the sections to which it is subject` (`s 561(5) test record` NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST TRUE) NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 561(5) section 561 is displaced by one of the sections to which it is subject` (`s 561(5) test record` NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST TRUE) NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 561(5) section 561 is displaced by one of the sections to which it is subject` (`s 561(5) test record` NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 561(5) section 561 is displaced by one of the sections to which it is subject` (`s 561(5) test record` NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 561(5) section 561 is displaced by one of the sections to which it is subject` (`s 561(5) test record` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 561(1): a company must not allot equity securities to a person unless it has offered and the period has expired; subject to (5).
#ASSERT `s 561(1) the company is prohibited from allotting the equity securities to the person` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 561(1) the company is prohibited from allotting the equity securities to the person` TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 561(1) the company is prohibited from allotting the equity securities to the person` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 561(1) the company is prohibited from allotting the equity securities to the person` TRUE NOTHING (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 561(1) the company is prohibited from allotting the equity securities to the person` TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 561(1) the company is prohibited from allotting the equity securities to the person` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 561(1) the company is prohibited from allotting the equity securities to the person` FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 562(2): the offer may be made in hard copy or electronic form.
#ASSERT `s 562(2) the offer may be made in this form` `hard copy form` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 562(2) the offer may be made in this form` `electronic form` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 562(3): Gazette publication if the holder has no UK or EEA address (registered or given) or holds a share warrant.
#ASSERT `s 562(3) the offer may be made by causing it, or a notice of where it can be obtained, to be published in the Gazette` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was #ASSERT `s 562(3) the offer may be made by causing it, or a notice of where it can be obtained, to be published in the Gazette` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE; the function is named for a grant or power ("may", "entitled"), so a failed "if" or "where" answers NOTHING, not JUST FALSE (fork F-grant-gate, name test of 2026-11-12); the facts are unchanged
